{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1345","published":"2026-02-13T11:10:22Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:32.661995794Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-14242"],"summary":"vsftpd security update","details":"Vsftpd, (or very secure FTP daemon), is an FTP server for Unix-like systems, including Linux. It is licensed under the GNU General Public License. It supports IPv6 and SSL. Vsftpd supports explicit (since 2.0.0) and implicit (since 2.1.0) FTPS.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in vsftpd. This vulnerability allows a denial of service (DoS) via an integer overflow in the ls command parameter parsing, triggered by a remote, authenticated attacker sending a crafted STAT command with a specific byte sequence.(CVE-2025-14242)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"vsftpd","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/vsftpd&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["vsftpd-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","vsftpd-debuginfo-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","vsftpd-debugsource-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","vsftpd-help-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["vsftpd-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["vsftpd-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","vsftpd-debuginfo-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","vsftpd-debugsource-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","vsftpd-help-3.0.3-33.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1345.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vsftpd","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/vsftpd&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.0.3-34.oe2203sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["vsftpd-3.0.3-34.oe2203sp4.aarch64.rpm","vsftpd-debuginfo-3.0.3-34.oe2203sp4.aarch64.rpm","vsftpd-debugsource-3.0.3-34.oe2203sp4.aarch64.rpm","vsftpd-help-3.0.3-34.oe2203sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["vsftpd-3